<h2 id="importer-les-six-bandes-spectrales">2. Importer les six bandes
spectrales</h2>
<p><strong>Objectif :</strong> Créer un objet pour chacune des bandes B2
à B7.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb4"><pre class="sourceCode r"><code class="sourceCode r"><span id="cb4-1"><a href="#cb4-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>b2 <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">rast</span>(<span class="st">&quot;data/camargue/LC09_L2SP_196030_20240805_20240806_02_T1_REFL_B2.tif&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb4-2"><a href="#cb4-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>b3 <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">rast</span>(<span class="st">&quot;data/camargue/LC09_L2SP_196030_20240805_20240806_02_T1_REFL_B3.tif&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb4-3"><a href="#cb4-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>b4 <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">rast</span>(<span class="st">&quot;data/camargue/LC09_L2SP_196030_20240805_20240806_02_T1_REFL_B4.tif&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb4-4"><a href="#cb4-4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>b5 <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">rast</span>(<span class="st">&quot;data/camargue/LC09_L2SP_196030_20240805_20240806_02_T1_REFL_B5.tif&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb4-5"><a href="#cb4-5" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>b6 <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">rast</span>(<span class="st">&quot;data/camargue/LC09_L2SP_196030_20240805_20240806_02_T1_REFL_B6.tif&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb4-6"><a href="#cb4-6" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>b7 <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">rast</span>(<span class="st">&quot;data/camargue/LC09_L2SP_196030_20240805_20240806_02_T1_REFL_B7.tif&quot;</span>)</span>
<span id="cb4-7"><a href="#cb4-7" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>b2</span></code></pre></div>
<pre><code>class       : SpatRaster 
